        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "Go learn to drive, you idiots.\n\nI have a toddler in my car, you're crammed into my suitcase, and you're weaving around so I have to go faster. I'm driving at the speed limit, though. Then the driver passes me and does the same thing to the person in front of me before passing them too, only to run a red light. It's ridiculous for a company to hire such dangerous drivers; something serious is going to happen, it's written in the stars. You should check if your drivers are drinking and driving because that's what it looked like.",
